WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.322 --> 01:47.897
=Episode 23=

01:47.947 --> 01:50.387
(Unite and strive
for even greater victories.)

01:50.387 --> 01:51.348
I used to think

01:51.628 --> 01:53.588
that Fei Ni just wasn't

01:53.868 --> 01:54.788
reliable enough.

01:56.187 --> 01:58.027
She had a good factory job,

01:58.307 --> 01:58.948
yet

01:58.948 --> 02:01.387
she kept dreaming about college
and trying to climb higher.

02:03.187 --> 02:04.148
But now,

02:04.387 --> 02:06.348
she's really changed my mind.

02:07.547 --> 02:09.788
You know what they say,
you become who you're around.

02:10.228 --> 02:11.827
Spending every day with a hero,

02:12.107 --> 02:14.427
her political awareness has
grown by leaps and bounds.

02:14.827 --> 02:16.348
It's not awareness.

02:16.508 --> 02:17.427
She loves him.

02:21.267 --> 02:21.908
Ye Feng,

02:22.197 --> 02:23.036
have a lychee.

02:40.387 --> 02:41.348
Well, Mom,

02:42.147 --> 02:43.547
our Publicity Division

02:43.547 --> 02:45.188
still has an opening, right?

02:45.628 --> 02:47.748
Ling Yi is graduating soon.

02:48.147 --> 02:49.948
You know how good her writing is.

02:50.093 --> 02:52.448
She'd be more than qualified
for the Publicity Division.

02:56.147 --> 02:57.228
Weren't you

02:58.107 --> 02:59.948
planning to work at the newspaper

03:00.228 --> 03:01.427
after graduation?

03:02.748 --> 03:03.667
She told me

03:04.308 --> 03:06.107
staff positions there are limited.

03:06.308 --> 03:07.948
At best, she'd only get a temporary post.

03:08.188 --> 03:09.748
So I decided not to let her go.

03:10.147 --> 03:10.948
Besides,

03:11.026 --> 03:12.180
what's great about that place

03:12.188 --> 03:13.950
compared to Jiangcheng
No. 1 Textile Factory?

03:14.387 --> 03:14.948
Mom,

03:15.147 --> 03:15.867
if she wants in,

03:16.188 --> 03:17.707
she only needs a word from you.

03:21.827 --> 03:23.587
The factory has procedures for hiring.

03:24.028 --> 03:25.628
I can't just bend the rules.

03:25.827 --> 03:27.028
As a director,

03:27.628 --> 03:28.667
I can't play favorites.

03:29.587 --> 03:31.188
I'm not asking you to bend the rules.

03:31.587 --> 03:33.107
Just crack them a little.

03:33.107 --> 03:34.827
Ling Yi will handle the rest.

03:35.387 --> 03:36.028
Besides,

03:36.547 --> 03:39.308
when it comes to education and writing,

03:39.788 --> 03:41.987
Ling Yi absolutely qualifies
for our Publicity Division.

03:47.228 --> 03:48.028
All right.

03:48.387 --> 03:50.508
I'll speak to Chief Wang later

03:50.788 --> 03:52.348
and see what kind of candidates

03:52.648 --> 03:54.300
our Publicity Division needs this year.

03:56.848 --> 03:57.700
Don't just sit there.

03:57.707 --> 03:58.667
You should thank her.

03:58.667 --> 03:59.707
Thanks, Mom.

03:59.707 --> 04:00.827
Don't thank me yet.

04:01.147 --> 04:03.228
This depends on what Chief Wang says.

04:03.827 --> 04:06.028
If she thinks you're not suitable,

04:06.427 --> 04:07.628
there's nothing I can do.

04:09.107 --> 04:09.547
All right.

04:10.347 --> 04:10.787
Mom,

04:10.835 --> 04:11.795
have a lychee.

04:13.508 --> 04:14.107
By the way,

04:15.068 --> 04:16.827
are the clothes downstairs dry?

04:17.308 --> 04:17.988
Go bring them in.

04:33.027 --> 04:35.308
From now on,
if Ling Yi needs a favor from me,

04:35.628 --> 04:37.387
don't speak for her.

04:37.387 --> 04:38.948
Let her tell me herself.

04:38.948 --> 04:40.387
She's my wife.

04:40.748 --> 04:42.907
Isn't it the same
whether she asks or I do?

04:42.907 --> 04:44.227
Of course it's not the same.

04:45.628 --> 04:46.347
If she asks,

04:46.868 --> 04:48.387
she owes me a favor.

04:48.508 --> 04:50.827
If you ask,
it's just between mother and son.

04:51.428 --> 04:52.428
Do you understand?

04:53.188 --> 04:55.147
Ever since
Ling Yi married into this family,

04:55.147 --> 04:57.787
she's been sending you to talk to me.

04:57.948 --> 04:58.787
What does she do?

04:59.108 --> 05:00.347
She hides behind you.

05:01.827 --> 05:03.628
You were right back then.

05:03.948 --> 05:04.948
College graduates

05:05.188 --> 05:06.387
are full of schemes.

05:27.628 --> 05:28.267
I'm off.

05:36.347 --> 05:37.508
You get in first.

05:40.308 --> 05:41.628
I'll hang your bag on the back.

05:48.787 --> 05:49.988
I'm your bag.

05:53.072 --> 05:54.628
I'm going with you.

05:54.628 --> 05:56.347
I want to see if you're living well

05:56.347 --> 05:57.428
at Qu Hua's place.

06:00.027 --> 06:00.907
Relax.

06:01.587 --> 06:02.748
I'm doing fine there.

06:03.204 --> 06:04.937
My brother-in-law takes good care of me.

06:05.587 --> 06:07.428
I just want to see for myself.

06:08.185 --> 06:08.622
Let's go.

06:09.188 --> 06:09.508
Go.

06:14.835 --> 06:15.535
Fei Ni.

06:18.782 --> 06:19.980
I'm not staying at his place.

06:38.222 --> 06:44.335
(Please keep the area clean.
No smoking.)

06:49.827 --> 06:51.907
How many beds have we shared now?

06:53.787 --> 06:55.188
First, the bunk bed.

06:58.988 --> 07:00.587
Then that double bed with the railing.

07:01.827 --> 07:02.787
Here's a dividing line.

07:05.628 --> 07:06.907
(The cot in the quake shelter.)

07:08.787 --> 07:10.188
(The bench in the factory office.)

07:12.428 --> 07:13.827
And now this makeshift table bed.

07:17.827 --> 07:18.748
When I think about it,

07:20.188 --> 07:22.428
we've slept on some pretty strange beds.

07:24.308 --> 07:26.707
But looking back now,

07:28.604 --> 07:29.700
everyone feels special.

07:46.027 --> 07:46.827
Fang Muyang,

07:49.387 --> 07:50.387
I'm so lucky to have you.

08:25.497 --> 08:31.160
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

08:33.107 --> 08:34.107
Chief Wang,

08:34.268 --> 08:35.987
(Model Worker)
please don't hold back.

08:36.188 --> 08:38.068
For this year's
Publicity Division recruitment,

08:38.068 --> 08:40.827
whatever the requirements are,
just tell me.

08:43.308 --> 08:44.188
Ms. Xu,

08:44.428 --> 08:46.388
are you recommending a strong talent

08:46.627 --> 08:47.867
to our division?

08:48.707 --> 08:49.707
Strong?

08:49.707 --> 08:50.867
She's certainly capable.

08:51.308 --> 08:52.668
As for being a real talent,

08:52.668 --> 08:54.107
that's for you to decide.

08:55.827 --> 08:57.428
Ling Yi, Ye Feng's wife.

08:58.507 --> 08:59.235
You know her.

08:59.308 --> 08:59.788
Yes, yes.

08:59.987 --> 09:01.467
A student from Jiangcheng University.

09:01.948 --> 09:03.148
She writes beautifully.

09:04.627 --> 09:06.467
She's hoping to join
our Publicity Division.

09:09.788 --> 09:11.827
As the director of the factory office,

09:12.028 --> 09:13.388
I can't play favorites.

09:13.627 --> 09:15.347
I need to understand
your division's needs.

09:15.347 --> 09:15.867
Indeed.

09:15.867 --> 09:16.308
Right?

09:17.188 --> 09:17.948
Ms. Xu,

09:18.148 --> 09:19.388
to be honest,

09:19.507 --> 09:20.788
we've been hoping to recruit

09:20.827 --> 09:24.028
a female graduate
from Jiangcheng University,

09:24.188 --> 09:25.467
but we haven't found one.

09:25.707 --> 09:28.467
Comrade Ling Yi is exactly who we need.

09:29.227 --> 09:30.268
Chief Wang,

09:30.987 --> 09:33.467
you have to handle this fairly.

09:33.507 --> 09:35.068
No special favors.

09:35.867 --> 09:37.047
That's not a special favor,

09:37.085 --> 09:37.646
Ms. Xu.

09:37.987 --> 09:40.028
Having a Jiangcheng University graduate

09:40.028 --> 09:42.227
is an honor for our department.

09:43.268 --> 09:43.827
Ms. Xu,

09:44.308 --> 09:46.668
when does Comrade Ling Yi graduate?

09:46.668 --> 09:47.987
Could she start right away?

09:48.227 --> 09:49.668
We're short-staffed at the moment.

09:50.107 --> 09:51.188
I'll let her know

09:51.204 --> 09:52.850
and have her onboard
as soon as possible.

09:53.068 --> 09:53.467
Great.

09:53.707 --> 09:54.268
Ms. Xu,

09:54.268 --> 09:55.268
thank you for your help.

09:55.268 --> 09:56.428
No, thank you for your help.

09:56.428 --> 09:56.908
Not at all.

09:56.908 --> 09:57.860
I'll get back to work.

09:57.908 --> 09:58.388
Go ahead.

09:58.467 --> 09:59.428
All right.

10:15.987 --> 10:17.107
Here you go, Sir.

10:23.507 --> 10:24.388
Careful, it's hot.

10:24.388 --> 10:25.507
Thanks, Sir.

10:26.268 --> 10:28.028
Fresh roasted sweet potatoes.

10:28.467 --> 10:29.227
Hot sweet potatoes.

10:33.537 --> 10:34.893
Want a roasted sweet potato?

10:36.068 --> 10:38.268
You picked a pretty hidden spot.

10:40.188 --> 10:40.908
Hey, hey.

10:41.668 --> 10:42.467
Don't get me wrong.

10:42.582 --> 10:43.700
I'm in the same line of work.

10:43.860 --> 10:44.893
I used to roast them, too.

10:45.188 --> 10:46.068
Got caught once.

10:47.908 --> 10:49.428
Be extra careful on Fridays.

10:49.428 --> 10:51.268
That's when they caught me.

10:54.707 --> 10:55.987
Nice setup with the barrel.

10:57.908 --> 10:58.827
The clay seal's decent.

10:58.937 --> 10:59.715
Nice and thick.

11:00.388 --> 11:01.627
Wrong sweet potatoes, though.

11:01.627 --> 11:03.668
These won't cook through.

11:04.668 --> 11:05.467
Like this one.

11:05.580 --> 11:06.915
This kind roasts well.

11:07.948 --> 11:09.068
Yours is almost burnt inside.

11:09.070 --> 11:10.068
Let me see your charcoal.

11:10.107 --> 11:10.388
Hey.

11:10.908 --> 11:12.467
What exactly are you doing?

11:24.827 --> 11:25.467
Jianshe,

11:25.467 --> 11:26.788
dig in.

11:26.820 --> 11:27.737
Thank you, Uncle Ting.

11:28.867 --> 11:29.668
Everything's ready.

11:29.747 --> 11:30.548
Come sit and eat.

11:32.028 --> 11:32.827
Come on, let's eat.

11:33.827 --> 11:34.627
Dig in.

11:35.148 --> 11:35.627
Fei Ting,

11:36.004 --> 11:37.204
busy at the factory today?

11:39.227 --> 11:40.587
Yeah, very busy.

11:41.867 --> 11:42.507
Lately,

11:43.107 --> 11:43.707
with

11:43.948 --> 11:44.747
the relief work,

11:45.948 --> 11:47.987
a lot of outstanding workers

11:48.148 --> 11:49.028
have stepped up.

11:49.587 --> 11:51.227
Our Publicity Division

11:51.268 --> 11:52.148
has been swamped.

11:52.347 --> 11:54.347
There's a mountain of reports to write.

11:55.668 --> 11:56.908
Why didn't you

11:57.107 --> 11:58.948
roast any sweet potatoes for them?

12:00.548 --> 12:01.227
What?

12:01.668 --> 12:02.388
Sweet potatoes?

12:03.182 --> 12:04.220
What are you talking about?

12:04.587 --> 12:06.268
I heard you're not even working.

12:06.268 --> 12:09.347
You've been teaching people
how to roast sweet potatoes.

12:09.467 --> 12:10.668
Miss it that much?

12:10.760 --> 12:11.980
Going back to your old trade?

12:12.268 --> 12:13.467
What are you saying?

12:14.068 --> 12:15.347
What old trade?

12:15.428 --> 12:16.548
Am I wrong?

12:16.668 --> 12:18.587
Ask your dear Fei Ting.

12:18.987 --> 12:20.068
During the earthquake,

12:20.068 --> 12:21.827
Mom and Dad loved the sweet potatoes.

12:22.587 --> 12:23.507
No wonder.

12:24.587 --> 12:25.227
Fei Ting,

12:25.467 --> 12:26.388
what's going on?

12:26.471 --> 12:28.471
Why are you
selling roasted sweet potatoes?

12:40.668 --> 12:41.107
Lin Mei,

12:41.788 --> 12:42.747
what's going on?

12:46.227 --> 12:46.627
Dad,

12:46.788 --> 12:47.227
Mom,

12:48.347 --> 12:50.428
I did sell roasted
sweet potatoes for a while.

12:53.548 --> 12:55.388
What about your job
in the Publicity Division?

12:55.948 --> 12:57.268
I no longer work there.

12:58.188 --> 12:59.948
But Mom and Dad, don't worry.

13:00.068 --> 13:03.068
Now, whenever I have time,
I cook at banquet events.

13:03.587 --> 13:05.627
I'm earning
a decent amount every month,

13:05.627 --> 13:06.747
and I can support Lin Mei.

13:07.227 --> 13:07.788
Wait...

13:08.467 --> 13:10.068
Why didn't you tell us? This is serious!

13:10.068 --> 13:11.227
Exactly. Silly!

13:11.227 --> 13:11.908
Jianshe,

13:11.908 --> 13:13.827
your aunt really had good judgment.

13:14.093 --> 13:16.340
We wanted her
to marry a guy from the transport team,

13:16.347 --> 13:17.347
but she refused.

13:17.420 --> 13:18.782
She insisted on marrying Fei Ting.

13:19.026 --> 13:19.820
She must have known

13:19.827 --> 13:21.867
he'd be someone
who makes big money someday.

13:21.867 --> 13:22.948
If nothing else,

13:23.068 --> 13:25.227
there'll always be enough
roasted sweet potatoes.

13:25.428 --> 13:28.148
If you want some, just go to your aunt.

13:28.948 --> 13:29.827
Really?

13:29.987 --> 13:31.827
Are they that profitable now?

13:32.028 --> 13:32.747
Dad, Mom,

13:32.747 --> 13:33.388
I'll go

13:33.404 --> 13:34.620
roast sweet potatoes tomorrow.

13:34.627 --> 13:35.347
Shut it.

13:35.347 --> 13:36.467
You'd better not.

13:36.467 --> 13:37.747
I'd be too embarrassed.

13:39.188 --> 13:40.827
Stop with the sarcasm.

13:40.982 --> 13:42.737
What's so embarrassing about his work?

13:43.071 --> 13:45.060
If Fei Ting hadn't been
around these past days,

13:45.627 --> 13:46.388
Mom and Dad

13:46.388 --> 13:47.188
would have starved.

13:48.648 --> 13:50.580
We're talking
about Fei Ting's job right now.

13:51.068 --> 13:52.428
Why are you bringing that up?

13:52.827 --> 13:53.668
Mom,

13:54.548 --> 13:56.068
you can't play favorites like this.

13:56.227 --> 13:58.388
Fei Ting and I have been

13:58.388 --> 13:59.948
spending money and doing the work.

14:00.388 --> 14:01.788
The moment they come back,

14:01.788 --> 14:02.827
we're suddenly outsiders.

14:02.827 --> 14:03.668
That's enough.

14:07.747 --> 14:09.028
We said it for your own good.

14:10.004 --> 14:11.115
He's already lost his job!

14:11.182 --> 14:12.026
Stop defending him!

14:12.347 --> 14:13.668
You're too naive.

14:30.068 --> 14:31.467
He can always find another one.

14:33.137 --> 14:34.537
But the way you're acting,

14:36.148 --> 14:37.747
it's like you never saw us as family.

14:42.627 --> 14:43.188
Fei Ting,

14:43.668 --> 14:44.388
let's go.

14:45.188 --> 14:46.388
I'm never coming back again.

15:02.908 --> 15:03.308
Dad,

15:03.987 --> 15:04.428
Mom,

15:05.227 --> 15:06.268
I'll say this again.

15:07.668 --> 15:08.987
As long as I'm still alive,

15:09.893 --> 15:11.660
I won't let Lin Mei suffer any hardship.

15:31.580 --> 15:32.382
This is all on you.

15:33.028 --> 15:34.467
You threw away a perfectly good job.

15:35.068 --> 15:36.747
Now we're being humiliated.

15:38.388 --> 15:38.668
Yeah.

15:39.148 --> 15:39.867
It's on me.

15:40.227 --> 15:40.908
Honey,

15:41.227 --> 15:41.827
go on.

15:41.827 --> 15:42.388
Hit me.

15:42.467 --> 15:43.227
Take it out on me.

15:47.548 --> 15:48.587
Harder.

15:48.987 --> 15:50.428
You've got to let it out today.

15:50.587 --> 15:50.948
Come on.

16:14.347 --> 16:16.227
Don't ever pull something
that stupid again.

16:17.268 --> 16:18.467
I won't go easy on you.

16:19.908 --> 16:20.548
Okay.

16:21.068 --> 16:21.987
I promise.

16:22.467 --> 16:23.268
From now on,

16:23.493 --> 16:24.580
I'll run everything by you.

16:25.188 --> 16:26.388
You need to find a job fast.

16:27.587 --> 16:28.227
I know.

16:28.627 --> 16:29.428
I will.

16:34.467 --> 16:35.068
Let's go home.

16:41.188 --> 16:43.668
Worst case, I'll go back
to selling roasted sweet potatoes.

16:43.668 --> 16:44.467
Don't you dare.

16:45.227 --> 16:46.188
I'm kidding.

16:47.848 --> 16:48.937
You want another slap?

16:56.467 --> 16:56.908
Uncle Fu.

16:57.693 --> 16:58.260
Mr. Yuan.

16:59.227 --> 16:59.587
Come in.

16:59.587 --> 17:00.388
Have a seat.

17:03.068 --> 17:03.747
Yang,

17:05.780 --> 17:08.026
I spoke with the folks
at the publishing house.

17:08.507 --> 17:09.227
They think

17:09.227 --> 17:10.828
your comic

17:10.828 --> 17:12.987
is good enough to publish.

17:17.588 --> 17:18.307
However,

17:18.588 --> 17:20.628
considering you're still young

17:20.787 --> 17:21.828
and new to this,

17:22.987 --> 17:23.707
they're hoping

17:23.948 --> 17:24.987
you and Mr. Yuan

17:25.507 --> 17:27.668
can work on it together,

17:27.868 --> 17:28.747
and then publish it.

17:29.148 --> 17:30.027
What do you think?

17:30.787 --> 17:31.628
Of course, Fang,

17:31.908 --> 17:33.507
you'll be credited as the author.

17:33.787 --> 17:34.510
Don't worry.

17:35.108 --> 17:35.707
Mr. Yuan,

17:35.987 --> 17:36.467
Uncle Fu,

17:36.987 --> 17:37.787
don't worry.

17:38.108 --> 17:39.108
I don't mind the credit.

17:39.348 --> 17:39.987
I just hope

17:39.987 --> 17:41.507
more people get to see their story.

17:42.588 --> 17:43.948
Mr. Yuan, tell us what you think.

17:43.948 --> 17:44.267
Go on.

17:45.060 --> 17:45.604
All right.

17:46.027 --> 17:46.707
Well,

17:46.960 --> 17:48.140
since we're co-creating this,

17:49.027 --> 17:50.027
I'll be frank.

17:50.027 --> 17:50.948
I'm all ears.

17:51.428 --> 17:52.868
Most of the comic's stories

17:53.348 --> 17:53.868
are strong.

17:54.628 --> 17:55.747
But a few of them

17:55.828 --> 17:56.707
don't feel believable.

17:57.108 --> 17:58.148
Take this one, for example.

17:59.428 --> 18:01.148
A female worker from a textile factory

18:01.588 --> 18:03.188
travels alone to the disaster zone,

18:03.787 --> 18:06.227
and then walks 50 km
to the epicenter to help.

18:06.428 --> 18:07.227
This can't be true.

18:08.227 --> 18:09.628
It is true, Mr. Yuan.

18:10.547 --> 18:11.828
Those are all real events.

18:13.787 --> 18:14.388
Fang,

18:16.467 --> 18:18.787
you need to understand the difference

18:18.787 --> 18:19.828
between factual truth

18:20.547 --> 18:21.747
and artistic truth.

18:21.828 --> 18:22.588
First of all,

18:22.747 --> 18:24.507
why would a textile worker

18:24.787 --> 18:25.787
go to a disaster zone?

18:26.547 --> 18:28.108
Weaving cloth?

18:28.108 --> 18:28.908
Spinning yarn?

18:29.507 --> 18:30.787
Readers are

18:30.787 --> 18:32.027
going to question that.

18:32.908 --> 18:34.307
So my suggestion is,

18:35.148 --> 18:37.108
you can keep the character,

18:37.507 --> 18:39.787
but change her into
a nurse from a hospital.

18:39.787 --> 18:40.588
No.

18:41.027 --> 18:42.828
She's a textile worker.

18:46.948 --> 18:47.348
Mr. Yuan,

18:47.507 --> 18:47.987
Uncle Fu,

18:48.348 --> 18:48.908
hear me out.

18:49.507 --> 18:50.628
In my comic,

18:51.067 --> 18:52.948
every character is
based on a real person.

18:53.787 --> 18:55.307
This textile worker

18:55.668 --> 18:57.227
is my wife, Comrade Fei Ni.

18:58.747 --> 18:59.828
I can vouch for that.

18:59.828 --> 19:01.948
Fei Ni really did go
to the disaster zone.

19:02.787 --> 19:03.348
Fu,

19:03.787 --> 19:05.428
if she's his wife,

19:05.428 --> 19:06.628
it's even worse.

19:07.307 --> 19:09.628
This comic was assigned
by the organization.

19:10.747 --> 19:12.747
And you're putting your wife in it?

19:12.747 --> 19:13.987
That's favouritism.

19:14.348 --> 19:15.428
That is not true.

19:16.267 --> 19:16.707
Mr. Yuan,

19:17.426 --> 19:18.782
my comic doesn't just feature

19:18.908 --> 19:20.267
my wife, Fei Ni.

19:20.267 --> 19:21.067
It also shows

19:21.067 --> 19:22.067
citizens

19:22.067 --> 19:23.467
from every walk of life.

19:23.626 --> 19:25.550
Even if you're not
mixing work and private life,

19:25.588 --> 19:27.828
your comic still has major issues.

19:28.108 --> 19:29.227
The character types overlap

19:29.460 --> 19:30.581
with no clear heroic model.

19:30.935 --> 19:31.895
Not just Fei Ni's role,

19:32.227 --> 19:33.639
all the other non-typical characters

19:33.640 --> 19:35.226
and their stories need revising.

19:35.293 --> 19:36.740
Since we're co-creating this,

19:37.027 --> 19:38.987
you need to take my advice seriously.

19:39.428 --> 19:40.507
I can't afford mistakes.

19:40.507 --> 19:41.747
Maybe we shouldn't co-create it.

19:43.220 --> 19:43.960
What did you say?

19:44.108 --> 19:44.547
Mr. Yuan,

19:44.987 --> 19:46.307
if you can't accept my comic,

19:46.467 --> 19:47.388
forget it.

19:47.547 --> 19:49.027
You think I'm after your credit?

19:49.467 --> 19:50.148
Without me,

19:50.148 --> 19:52.148
this comic won't get published.

19:52.908 --> 19:54.628
If Fu hadn't begged for my help,

19:54.628 --> 19:55.420
I wouldn't be here.

19:55.467 --> 19:56.428
Fu, you know

19:56.428 --> 19:57.707
how busy I am.

19:58.188 --> 19:58.628
I only came

19:58.628 --> 19:59.307
for your sake.

19:59.307 --> 20:00.588
Right, right.

20:00.782 --> 20:01.820
You're right, Mr. Yuan.

20:01.828 --> 20:03.348
Please calm down. Let's all calm down.

20:03.628 --> 20:04.547
I'll talk to him.

20:07.547 --> 20:08.027
Yang.

20:09.787 --> 20:10.188
Boy,

20:10.188 --> 20:10.987
listen to me.

20:10.987 --> 20:12.388
Let's step outside.

20:29.348 --> 20:29.947
Yang.

20:29.997 --> 20:31.948
Your work is excellent,

20:31.948 --> 20:34.787
but you're still new.

20:34.787 --> 20:35.828
You don't have a name yet.

20:36.227 --> 20:36.987
Who knows you?

20:37.547 --> 20:39.148
Mr. Yuan has a strong reputation.

20:39.267 --> 20:41.668
He carries real weight in publishing.

20:41.804 --> 20:42.740
With his name attached,

20:42.747 --> 20:44.787
it'll help your comic.

20:47.628 --> 20:48.428
Yang,

20:49.227 --> 20:51.747
this is your first credited work.

20:52.307 --> 20:54.747
If this one makes a splash,

20:55.428 --> 20:57.747
after that, you can
draw whatever you want.

20:58.388 --> 20:59.987
You could even

21:00.307 --> 21:01.467
make a whole album

21:01.522 --> 21:02.322
just for Fei Ni.

21:04.227 --> 21:05.307
No one would stop you.

21:05.707 --> 21:08.148
Listen to me.

21:08.227 --> 21:10.547
Go apologize to Mr. Yuan and revise it.

21:23.108 --> 21:23.787
Yang,

21:24.148 --> 21:25.908
be polite.

21:44.908 --> 21:45.348
Mr. Yuan,

21:47.108 --> 21:48.027
I won't change it.

21:49.148 --> 21:50.188
Not just Fei Ni.

21:50.628 --> 21:52.428
I won't change any of them.

21:53.108 --> 21:54.628
Every story in there is real.

21:54.948 --> 21:56.139
They risked their lives.

21:56.140 --> 21:57.004
What they did matters.

21:57.148 --> 21:58.227
It shouldn't be erased.

21:58.588 --> 21:58.987
Why you...

22:05.188 --> 22:06.227
You're unbelievable.

22:06.908 --> 22:08.067
Hold on to your little comic

22:08.188 --> 22:09.388
and keep it to yourself!

22:09.747 --> 22:10.267
Mr. Yuan...

22:10.348 --> 22:10.908
Yuan!

22:11.348 --> 22:12.348
Leave me alone, Fu.

22:31.372 --> 22:32.172
Fang Muyang,

22:33.227 --> 22:34.027
what's the occasion?

22:34.027 --> 22:35.828
You even picked a place this fancy.

22:36.300 --> 22:37.493
I want to show you something.

22:39.747 --> 22:40.747
You finished it?

22:41.148 --> 22:41.628
Yeah.

22:42.067 --> 22:44.348
I was going to wait
until it was published.

22:48.747 --> 22:50.348
But I wanted you to see it first.

22:53.668 --> 22:54.828
It's beautiful.

22:56.067 --> 22:57.227
That's Lu Aijun, right?

22:57.348 --> 22:58.828
I remember how strong he was.

23:01.067 --> 23:02.027
Chen Guoqiang.

23:02.668 --> 23:03.908
I never understood him.

23:03.908 --> 23:05.467
Why does he always look like

23:05.467 --> 23:06.868
someone owes him money?

23:08.428 --> 23:09.747
But he's actually a good guy.

23:13.348 --> 23:15.628
And that's our brother-in-law, right?

23:15.668 --> 23:17.828
You even drew the mole by his mouth.

23:30.908 --> 23:31.868
Do I get the look right?

23:39.747 --> 23:42.507
Looking at this brings back so much.

23:48.868 --> 23:49.868
When does it come out?

23:52.707 --> 23:53.348
Soon.

24:02.428 --> 24:03.428
Comrade Fang Muyang

24:03.628 --> 24:06.828
is the most talented artist
I've ever met.

24:07.507 --> 24:08.227
His masterpiece

24:08.547 --> 24:10.707
will soon be seen
all across the country.

24:11.908 --> 24:13.507
Thank you, Fei Ni, for the praise.

24:14.067 --> 24:15.148
I'll keep working hard.

24:17.467 --> 24:18.547
My treat today.

24:18.737 --> 24:19.820
Order whatever you like.

24:21.348 --> 24:21.908
Excuse me.

24:21.908 --> 24:22.668
We'd like to order.

24:26.027 --> 24:26.707
(Yang,)

24:26.707 --> 24:28.348
(won't you reconsider?)

24:29.067 --> 24:30.027
I've thought it through.

24:31.448 --> 24:32.500
I'm not changing it.

24:38.628 --> 24:40.428
It's such a great piece.

24:40.868 --> 24:42.507
If the publisher won't print it,

24:43.027 --> 24:44.948
and readers never get to see it,

24:46.067 --> 24:47.227
that would be a shame.

24:47.628 --> 24:48.148
It won't be.

24:49.448 --> 24:51.390
The one who matters most
has already seen it.

24:59.182 --> 25:01.220
What about running it
as a newspaper serial?

25:07.348 --> 25:08.188
Thank you, Uncle Fu.

25:10.947 --> 25:14.129
(Jiangcheng Daily)

25:14.130 --> 25:15.422
("Heroes in Earthquake Relief"
by Fang Muyang)

25:15.460 --> 25:17.337
(The Political Bureau
of the Central Committee)

25:17.426 --> 25:19.700
(acting on the will
of the Party and the people,)

25:19.707 --> 25:21.868
(took decisive measures)

25:21.868 --> 25:24.067
(to smash
the Gang of Four in one stroke.)

25:55.385 --> 25:58.397
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

26:01.108 --> 26:03.348
Now that the notice is out,
what will Ms. Xu do?

26:03.707 --> 26:04.868
Hard to say.

26:06.848 --> 26:09.448
(Notice on the Appointment
of Comrade Chen Jiansheng)

26:09.537 --> 26:12.715
(Comrade Chen Jiansheng is appointed
Vice Director of the factory.)

26:12.782 --> 26:16.700
(Arrangements for former Ms. Xu Hongqi
will be announced.)

26:16.707 --> 26:18.467
Welcome, welcome.

26:19.340 --> 26:21.628
(Chen Jiansheng)
Vice Director Chen, welcome.

26:21.987 --> 26:23.428
As soon as I heard

26:23.428 --> 26:25.868
the organization appointed
a new vice director,

26:26.908 --> 26:28.348
I gathered everyone

26:28.987 --> 26:30.067
to report

26:30.067 --> 26:32.148
on the factory's work to you.

26:34.027 --> 26:37.067
Over the past few years,
our comrades here

26:37.348 --> 26:40.148
have worked diligently and meticulously.

26:41.188 --> 26:41.948
From now on,

26:42.467 --> 26:43.547
we will

26:43.547 --> 26:46.108
continue to push even harder.

26:50.267 --> 26:52.108
Everyone, let's welcome
Vice Director Chen

26:52.108 --> 26:53.588
to give us guidance.

26:54.588 --> 26:55.267
Comrades,

26:55.507 --> 26:57.507
in line with national development goals,

26:57.668 --> 26:59.227
our factory's focus

26:59.388 --> 27:02.027
has shifted to improving
production efficiency.

27:02.828 --> 27:04.628
As Comrade Xu Hongqi

27:04.628 --> 27:06.267
has extensive frontline experience,

27:06.310 --> 27:07.747
the organization has decided

27:08.497 --> 27:10.628
to reassign her to her former post

27:10.908 --> 27:11.547
in Workshop One.

27:15.787 --> 27:17.747
We hope Comrade Xu Hongqi

27:17.747 --> 27:19.507
will continue to contribute

27:19.707 --> 27:21.948
even greater efforts.

27:22.188 --> 27:23.108
Vice Director,

27:24.307 --> 27:25.948
could there be some mistake?

27:27.108 --> 27:29.108
Should we check

27:29.507 --> 27:30.948
with the leadership again?

27:31.188 --> 27:32.668
As Director of the Factory Office,

27:33.307 --> 27:36.547
how can I go back to the workshop
as an ordinary worker?

27:37.188 --> 27:38.348
Comrade Xu Hongqi!

27:41.307 --> 27:43.507
Are you looking down
on frontline workers?

27:45.188 --> 27:45.787
Vice Director,

27:46.188 --> 27:47.868
I want to report Comrade Xu Hongqi.

27:49.588 --> 27:52.747
While serving as
Director of the Factory Office,

27:52.747 --> 27:53.948
she abused her position

27:53.948 --> 27:55.787
and asked Comrade Wang Xiaoman
to pull strings

27:55.787 --> 27:58.307
to fast-track her daughter-in-law
into the Publicity Division.

27:58.307 --> 27:59.348
I believe she is unfit

27:59.348 --> 28:00.948
to hold a leadership post.

28:01.267 --> 28:02.067
Feng Lin,

28:02.787 --> 28:04.188
what are you doing?

28:05.707 --> 28:07.547
That's a baseless accusation.

28:09.188 --> 28:11.348
When did I ever pull strings?

28:11.787 --> 28:13.507
I only asked her

28:13.507 --> 28:15.588
what the hiring requirements were

28:15.787 --> 28:17.948
for the Publicity Division this year!

28:17.948 --> 28:19.747
That question alone is pulling strings.

28:19.987 --> 28:21.227
Once you spoke up,

28:21.227 --> 28:22.948
would Chief Wang dare refuse?

28:22.948 --> 28:23.868
As far as I know,

28:23.868 --> 28:24.507
Ling Yi was

28:24.507 --> 28:26.019
given special clearance this year.

28:26.020 --> 28:27.230
The paperwork was nearly done!

28:27.248 --> 28:27.540
You...

28:27.547 --> 28:29.188
Vice Director, if you don't believe me,

28:29.188 --> 28:30.428
we can summon Chief Wang

28:30.428 --> 28:31.267
to verify this.

28:31.267 --> 28:31.987
Vice Director!

28:31.987 --> 28:32.948
Comrade Xu Hongqi,

28:33.348 --> 28:34.108
let's stay calm.

28:35.507 --> 28:36.388
Everyone,

28:36.388 --> 28:37.227
rest assured.

28:38.388 --> 28:40.588
The organization sent me here

28:40.948 --> 28:42.507
to straighten out the work culture

28:42.507 --> 28:43.547
and boost production.

28:46.467 --> 28:47.467
Comrade Xu Hongqi,

28:47.908 --> 28:49.108
I will

28:49.108 --> 28:50.348
investigate this matter

28:51.707 --> 28:52.507
thoroughly.

29:14.908 --> 29:15.428
Mom,

29:16.027 --> 29:17.467
please open the door.

29:17.787 --> 29:19.747
You haven't eaten all day.

29:19.848 --> 29:20.860
I made you some noodles.

29:20.868 --> 29:21.997
Just have a bite.

29:21.997 --> 29:25.828
(Certificate of Merit:
Comrade Xu Hongqi as Advanced Producer)

29:25.828 --> 29:26.307
Mom,

29:28.027 --> 29:29.908
working on the workshop
isn't a big deal.

29:30.267 --> 29:31.868
You always told us,

29:31.868 --> 29:33.307
there's no shame in honest labor.

29:38.428 --> 29:40.267
That's not why I'm upset!

29:44.428 --> 29:45.307
It's not that.

29:45.908 --> 29:47.307
I just can't accept

29:47.307 --> 29:48.908
the false charge Feng Lin threw at me.

29:53.428 --> 29:54.828
Pulling strings...

29:57.707 --> 29:59.467
When have I ever done that?

30:02.428 --> 30:03.897
I only spoke up

30:04.388 --> 30:06.348
for your sake.

30:36.348 --> 30:37.828
Maybe we should just go back.

30:37.828 --> 30:39.428
I've never begged anyone in my life.

30:40.148 --> 30:40.628
Ye Feng,

30:41.188 --> 30:42.507
when Mom was the Director,

30:42.507 --> 30:43.707
you stood behind her.

30:43.707 --> 30:44.628
Now she's stepped down,

30:44.628 --> 30:46.067
it's your turn to stand in front.

30:46.160 --> 30:47.961
But the official notice is already out.

30:48.047 --> 30:50.148
Even if we ask the Vice Director,
what can he do?

30:53.060 --> 30:54.382
Mom can go back to the workshop.

30:54.537 --> 30:56.900
But the accusation of pulling strings
has to be cleared.

30:57.267 --> 30:59.348
We can't let Feng Lin's smear stick.

30:59.400 --> 31:02.148
This isn't just about whether I get
a spot in the Publicity Division.

31:02.148 --> 31:03.668
It's about Mom's reputation.

31:10.740 --> 31:11.737
Vice Director Chen,

31:11.868 --> 31:13.668
I'm Xu Hongqi's daughter-in-law.

31:13.868 --> 31:16.148
The one Feng Lin says
got special favors.

31:19.348 --> 31:20.707
This is my portfolio.

31:20.868 --> 31:21.828
Please take a look.

31:21.828 --> 31:23.899
Am I qualified
to join the Publicity Division,

31:23.900 --> 31:25.360
or do I need anyone to pull strings?

31:35.348 --> 31:36.227
Comrade Ling Yi,

31:36.628 --> 31:37.388
Comrade Ye Feng,

31:38.067 --> 31:40.267
do you have no
political awareness at all?

31:40.547 --> 31:42.747
This has nothing to do
with how well you write.

31:42.908 --> 31:44.267
No matter how good your writing is,

31:44.467 --> 31:46.227
Xu Hongqi should never have

31:46.227 --> 31:47.148
spoken up for you.

31:47.547 --> 31:49.227
We came to see the Vice Director,

31:50.067 --> 31:50.828
not you.

31:50.828 --> 31:52.027
The Vice Director just arrived.

31:52.027 --> 31:53.507
He doesn't know the factory well yet.

31:53.507 --> 31:54.908
It's my duty to brief him.

31:54.908 --> 31:55.747
That's enough.

31:58.307 --> 31:59.227
Comrade Ling Yi,

31:59.707 --> 32:02.379
your writing is indeed impressive.

32:02.380 --> 32:04.848
The Publicity Division of
Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory

32:04.893 --> 32:06.540
would welcome a talent like you.

32:07.507 --> 32:08.428
As for

32:08.707 --> 32:10.908
the accusation
that Xu Hongqi pulled strings,

32:11.428 --> 32:13.908
that's only Comrade Feng Lin's claim.

32:14.348 --> 32:16.507
The organization has not
reached any conclusion.

32:17.260 --> 32:18.147
Vice Director Chen,

32:18.388 --> 32:20.067
how can you say it's just my word?

32:20.227 --> 32:20.868
We can ask...

32:20.868 --> 32:21.307
Feng Lin,

32:22.828 --> 32:24.388
constantly reporting

32:24.388 --> 32:26.267
and accusing fellow comrades

32:26.267 --> 32:27.267
is not constructive.

32:27.948 --> 32:30.547
If you have that much energy,
use it on your work.

32:31.747 --> 32:32.547
Vice Director,

32:33.227 --> 32:34.868
I did it for fairness and justice.

32:34.868 --> 32:36.348
That's why I reported Xu Hongqi.

32:36.348 --> 32:37.148
Is that so?

32:37.348 --> 32:38.027
Then,

32:38.188 --> 32:39.948
when Xu Hongqi

32:39.948 --> 32:41.507
was Director of the Factory Office,

32:41.604 --> 32:43.540
why didn't you report her
to the Party Secretary?

32:45.747 --> 32:46.227
I...

32:46.227 --> 32:47.467
That settles it.

32:50.067 --> 32:52.227
As for recruitment
to the Publicity Division,

32:52.227 --> 32:54.428
contact Chief Wang directly.

32:55.628 --> 32:56.467
And one more thing,

32:56.987 --> 33:00.348
please pass a message to Xu Hongqi.

33:00.348 --> 33:02.547
The country and the people
still need her.

33:02.868 --> 33:05.148
We hope she will continue

33:05.148 --> 33:06.467
to shine on the production front

33:06.908 --> 33:09.547
and contribute even more
to socialist development.

33:10.227 --> 33:11.027
Understood.

33:13.885 --> 33:14.685
Vice Director,

33:15.348 --> 33:17.747
may I request a few more days off
for my mother-in-law?

33:17.747 --> 33:19.108
She's had a high fever.

33:19.108 --> 33:20.948
She's still weak all over.

33:21.204 --> 33:22.940
She may need
a couple more days to recover.

33:26.868 --> 33:27.668
All right.

33:27.868 --> 33:29.547
Let her rest for now.

33:30.428 --> 33:31.027
I heard

33:31.027 --> 33:33.267
that when Xu Hongqi was young,

33:33.267 --> 33:35.348
she was a model worker at the factory.

33:35.908 --> 33:37.227
Back in the workshop,

33:37.467 --> 33:40.027
she could run more than
a dozen looms by herself,

33:40.027 --> 33:41.307
with barely any errors.

33:41.908 --> 33:42.707
Really?

33:44.067 --> 33:45.868
I've never heard my mom mention that.

33:48.148 --> 33:49.267
That just shows

33:49.588 --> 33:51.307
she never bragged
about her achievements.

33:51.868 --> 33:53.868
That spirit needs to come back.

33:54.747 --> 33:55.348
Ye Feng,

33:55.908 --> 33:57.787
when you get home,

33:57.868 --> 33:59.188
encourage your mother.

33:59.507 --> 34:01.227
The factory still needs her.

34:03.067 --> 34:03.628
Okay.

34:03.628 --> 34:04.148
We will.

34:04.467 --> 34:05.628
Thank you, Vice Director.

34:05.828 --> 34:07.108
We'll take our leave.

34:19.908 --> 34:20.908
Comrade Feng Lin.

34:21.547 --> 34:22.107
Vice Director.

34:22.547 --> 34:25.467
A young backbone like you

34:25.748 --> 34:26.868
is best suited

34:27.107 --> 34:28.708
to support the production front line.

34:29.107 --> 34:30.308
Starting tomorrow,

34:31.027 --> 34:33.748
report to the sizing workshop.

34:44.060 --> 34:46.247
(Jiangcheng Daily)

34:46.308 --> 34:46.987
Yang.

34:50.667 --> 34:52.228
Since your comic

34:52.360 --> 34:53.671
started running in the paper,

34:53.737 --> 34:55.140
the response has been overwhelming.

34:55.147 --> 34:56.908
We've received piles
of letters from readers.

34:56.908 --> 34:57.748
Take a look.

34:58.467 --> 35:00.147
They're all praising your work for being

35:00.147 --> 35:02.308
vivid, moving, and real.

35:03.748 --> 35:04.627
That many?

35:05.027 --> 35:06.147
Read them when you have time.

35:06.507 --> 35:07.107
I will.

35:07.388 --> 35:08.419
I'll read every one

35:08.420 --> 35:09.426
and reply to them all.

35:09.428 --> 35:10.228
Wait.

35:16.748 --> 35:18.107
This letter

35:18.547 --> 35:20.147
was sent from Yunnan.

35:21.866 --> 35:23.080
(Editorial Office, Jiangcheng Daily,
125 Kangping Road, Jiangcheng)

35:23.087 --> 35:24.522
(Forwarded by Fu Boquan to Fang Muyang.
Fang Qingyuan, Mengqing Farm, Yunnan)

35:26.828 --> 35:29.348
Your parents will be back soon.

35:30.467 --> 35:31.627
At last,

35:33.667 --> 35:35.428
your family will be reunited.

35:43.210 --> 35:45.075
(Editorial Office, Jiangcheng Daily,
125 Kangping Road, Jiangcheng)

35:45.076 --> 35:47.235
(Forwarded by Fu Boquan to Fang Muyang.
Fang Qingyuan, Mengqing Farm, Yunnan)

35:48.147 --> 35:49.388
Editor Liao, Fang,

35:49.507 --> 35:50.547
I'm heading out.

35:50.748 --> 35:51.348
Okay, Ms. Wang.

35:57.147 --> 35:57.948
Heading out, Fang?

35:58.908 --> 35:59.908
Not yet.

36:00.300 --> 36:01.360
My wife's picking me up.

36:02.708 --> 36:03.228
Lucky you.

36:03.300 --> 36:04.582
All right. I'll get going then.

36:06.547 --> 36:07.748
Comrade Fang,

36:08.700 --> 36:09.848
I'm here to take you home.

36:09.940 --> 36:10.626
Perfect timing.

36:11.147 --> 36:12.708
I was just reading letters from readers.

36:13.027 --> 36:14.627
Come here, take a look.

36:15.467 --> 36:16.310
That many?

36:16.507 --> 36:16.868
Yes.

36:16.987 --> 36:18.710
Especially this one.
Let me read it to you.

36:18.748 --> 36:20.708
It's from Comrade Tian Xueying.

36:21.147 --> 36:22.748
Sounds like a woman.

36:24.308 --> 36:25.107
Listen to this.

36:26.467 --> 36:28.027
Since the disaster struck,

36:28.027 --> 36:29.748
work on earthquake relief

36:30.027 --> 36:31.428
has poured out in waves.

36:32.507 --> 36:33.948
Yet most only skim the surface.

36:34.908 --> 36:36.228
Yours alone

36:36.826 --> 36:38.515
carries real feeling in every stroke,

36:38.828 --> 36:39.908
tears in every frame.

36:40.107 --> 36:42.147
The figures pressing forward
through storm and gust,

36:42.348 --> 36:43.107
their exhaustion,

36:43.708 --> 36:45.228
and their unwavering eyes,

36:46.107 --> 36:47.228
move the heart.

36:47.908 --> 36:48.868
Your brush

36:48.987 --> 36:50.987
captures not only
the cruelty of disaster,

36:51.828 --> 36:52.908
but also

36:54.228 --> 36:55.507
the brightest light of humanity.

36:58.115 --> 36:59.260
Beautifully written, right?

36:59.667 --> 37:00.467
It is.

37:01.107 --> 37:01.748
It shows

37:01.748 --> 37:05.027
your work truly resonates
with the people.

37:05.228 --> 37:05.948
So,

37:05.948 --> 37:08.708
Comrade Fang, you have to keep going.

37:08.708 --> 37:09.507
I will.

37:11.348 --> 37:11.868
Fei Ni,

37:13.547 --> 37:15.099
could you help me reply

37:15.100 --> 37:16.426
to this Comrade Tian Xueying?

37:16.982 --> 37:18.540
The president wants to start a column

37:18.708 --> 37:20.107
to publish readers' letters.

37:20.507 --> 37:21.828
They'll pick the best ones

37:21.828 --> 37:22.908
for me to answer personally.

37:24.748 --> 37:26.067
You know how I am with words.

37:27.382 --> 37:28.804
Maybe you could write it for me.

37:29.147 --> 37:31.908
If she wrote to you,

37:31.908 --> 37:35.308
she might not even be expecting a reply.

37:35.868 --> 37:37.908
And if you are going to reply,

37:37.908 --> 37:39.428
it should come from you.

37:39.428 --> 37:40.268
It'll mean more.

37:41.004 --> 37:42.300
I want to write back myself.

37:43.547 --> 37:44.868
But I need to go to Yunnan first.

37:45.868 --> 37:46.667
Yunnan?

37:47.547 --> 37:48.107
Why?

37:49.048 --> 37:50.820
My parents are coming back from Yunnan.

37:52.428 --> 37:53.268
I must pick them up.

38:14.348 --> 38:15.147
Mom,

38:16.667 --> 38:18.987
Ye Feng and I went to see
the Vice Director today.

38:23.308 --> 38:25.467
Why did you go see him?

38:27.667 --> 38:28.948
Don't plead for me.

38:29.828 --> 38:31.268
We didn't plead.

38:31.467 --> 38:33.828
I just showed him my writing.

38:35.467 --> 38:37.228
He said it was impressive.

38:37.507 --> 38:40.027
That I qualify for the job on my own.

38:40.507 --> 38:43.348
And the leadership hasn't
labeled you as pulling strings.

38:48.627 --> 38:50.122
Because I didn't.

38:51.507 --> 38:54.748
Vice Director Chen also
looked into your past.

38:54.908 --> 38:57.828
He knows you were once a model worker.

38:57.948 --> 39:00.868
You ran over a dozen looms by yourself,

39:00.868 --> 39:02.507
with the lowest error rate.

39:03.748 --> 39:07.268
He said the country
and the people still need you.

39:07.672 --> 39:09.672
He hopes you'll return
to the production line

39:09.710 --> 39:11.230
and keep shining,

39:11.467 --> 39:14.348
contributing even more
to socialist development.

39:27.908 --> 39:28.748
Mom,

39:29.348 --> 39:31.268
you haven't eaten in two days.

39:31.268 --> 39:32.268
Please have a bite.

39:36.067 --> 39:37.388
I'll go back to my room.

39:59.322 --> 40:01.610
